    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Misc.System.MaxFps.ToolTip">If you have disabled hardware acceleration, it is recommended to lower the maximum animation FPS to prevent excessive resource usage.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Misc.System.MaxLogLines">Real-time log lines</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Misc.System.MaxLogLines.ToolTip">Maximum number of lines displayed in the real-time log feature. Old logs are automatically deleted when exceeded.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Misc.System.Proxy.Hint">For example, http://127.0.0.1:1080/</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Misc.System.Title">System</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.Blur">Background blur</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.Blur.ToolTip">Strong blur can lower launcher frame rates.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.Clear">Clear all</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.ColorOverlay">Overlay colored background</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.ContentAdapt">Adaptive</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.OpenFolder.ToolTip">Place background images or videos in this folder. One will be chosen at random when the launcher opens.&#x0a;H.264 video usually plays more smoothly.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.PauseVideo">Pause video backgrounds while an instance is running</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.PauseVideo.ToolTip">If enabled, the background cannot be refreshed while the game is running</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.Refresh">Refresh</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.Refresh.ToolTip">Randomly load a background image or video from the folder.&#x0a;For smoother playback, videos are recommended to use H.264 encoding.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.Suit.BottomLeft">Bottom-left</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.Suit.BottomRight">Bottom-right</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.Suit.Center">Center</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.Suit.Fit">Fit</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.Suit.Fit.ToolTip">Stretch the content while keeping the aspect ratio until the entire window is filled.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.Suit.Smart">Smart</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.Suit.Smart.ToolTip">Select &quot;Tile&quot; when the content is small, and &quot;Fit&quot; when it is large.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.Suit.Stretch">Stretch</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.Suit.Stretch.ToolTip">Stretch the content to fill the entire window, which may alter the aspect ratio.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.Suit.Tile">Tile</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.Suit.TopLeft">Top-left</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.Suit.TopRight">Top-right</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Background.TitleDefault">Backgrounds</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Basic.AdvancedMaterial">Advanced material</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Basic.AdvancedMaterial.ToolTip">When enabled, blur effects will be applied to some transparent areas, such as cards.&#x0a;Note that this feature consumes significant GPU resources and may cause lag.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Basic.BlurMethod">Blur method</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Basic.BlurMethod.Box.ToolTip">Uses linear average sampling over a small area around each pixel, which is faster but may produce color blocks.&#x0a;This blur may lose detail information but has better performance. It can be used on devices with poor performance.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Basic.BlurMethod.Gaussian.ToolTip">A higher-quality blur that samples a wider area. It can be slower on some devices.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Basic.BlurMethod.ToolTip">Sets the blur method.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Basic.BlurRadius">Blur radius</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Basic.BlurRadius.ToolTip">Sets the sampling radius of the blur effect. Larger values produce stronger blur.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Basic.BlurSamplingRate">Sampling rate</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Basic.BlurSamplingRate.ToolTip">Sets the sampling rate of the blur effect. Higher values produce finer blur.&#x0a;If your device has poor performance, try lowering this value for better performance.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Setup.Ui.Basic.HintAlignRight">Show popup hints on the right side</sys:String>
